l your coffee, and for nothing else. We never sell or share them.</p\n        >\n        <p>Questions or a request to delete: <a href=\"mailto:privacy@example.com\">privacy@example.com</a></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dialog-footer\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" commandfor=\"kb-privacy\" command=\"close\">Close</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n</div>\n","individual":false}]
